{"about_the_game":"<strong>Futa Zone: Lewd Control</strong> is a 2D inspection simulator and visual novel set in a luxurious private resort for the world\u2019s most daring guests.<br>You play as a border officer stationed at the entrance to this secret paradise, responsible for enforcing the daily rules sent by the resort\u2019s owners.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/6add18d1527d225d90e03a706f84fae1.poster.avif?t=1762202183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/6add18d1527d225d90e03a706f84fae1.webm?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/6add18d1527d225d90e03a706f84fae1.mp4?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each day brings new conditions: maybe you must deny guests with certain preferences, or those hiding something unusual. Your duty is to inspect, question, and decide \u2014 but every mistake counts, and temptation is never far away.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Gameplay Overview</h2><br><strong>Daily Directives</strong><br>Begin each day with a message from the resort\u2019s management listing specific entry rules. These determine who can and cannot be admitted that day.<br><br><strong>Guest Inspection</strong><br>Examine passports, forms, and personal data. Compare information for inconsistencies \u2014 mismatched names, ages, or declared interests may signal deception.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/8388e57eef229eb513435327ed06b183.poster.avif?t=1762202183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/8388e57eef229eb513435327ed06b183.webm?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/8388e57eef229eb513435327ed06b183.mp4?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dialogues &amp; Reactions</strong><br>Interact with guests using a dialogue system. Ask questions, observe their responses, and catch contradictions.<br><br><strong>X-Ray Scanning</strong><br>Unlock the resort\u2019s signature tool \u2014 the X-Ray scanner. By hovering over specific areas, reveal hidden details that may confirm or disprove a guest\u2019s statements.<br><br><strong>Temperature Check</strong><br>Measure guests\u2019 body temperature to ensure they meet the daily entry criteria. A high reading might be more revealing than it seems.<br><br><strong>Pass or Deny</strong><br>Mark relevant checkboxes on your inspection sheet and use official stamps \u2014 \u201cApprove\u201d or \u201cReject.\u201d<br>Each decision affects your score. Three mistakes per day, and you\u2019ll have to restart your shift.<br><br><strong>Progress &amp; Choices</strong><br>Work through 7 in-game days, meet 29 unique guests, and encounter 3 key characters whose stories go far beyond the inspection desk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.poster.avif?t=1762202183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.webm?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.mp4?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf34 Features</h2>\ud83d\udc84 Immersive 2D visual style inspired by glossy 2000s aesthetics and stylized art.<br>\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f 7 days of branching scenarios with increasing difficulty and new mechanics.<br>\ud83d\udd25 X-Ray and thermal scanning systems for deeper gameplay interaction.<br>\ud83d\ude08 29 distinct characters, each with unique visuals, personalities, and secrets.<br>\ud83d\ude0f 3 story-driven encounters with extended dialogues and multiple outcomes.<br>\ud83d\udca6 A mix of simulation mechanics and narrative depth, blending humor, intrigue, and adult tension.<br>\ud83c\udfad Multiple endings depending on your accuracy and choices.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046550?t=1762202183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046550?t=1762202183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/7999c9ddf7e6914084dbf38c6e44c1c6ce71c105/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762202183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/7999c9ddf7e6914084dbf38c6e44c1c6ce71c105/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762202183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains content not appropriate for all ages, or for viewing at work: Sexual content, nudity.\r\nThe game graphically depicts sex.\r\nAll characters in the game are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<strong>Futa Zone: Lewd Control</strong> is a 2D inspection simulator and visual novel set in a luxurious private resort for the world\u2019s most daring guests.<br>You play as a border officer stationed at the entrance to this secret paradise, responsible for enforcing the daily rules sent by the resort\u2019s owners.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto