anning</strong><br>Unlock the resort\u2019s signature tool \u2014 the X-Ray scanner. By hovering over specific areas, reveal hidden details that may confirm or disprove a guest\u2019s statements.<br><br><strong>Temperature Check</strong><br>Measure guests\u2019 body temperature to ensure they meet the daily entry criteria. A high reading might be more revealing than it seems.<br><br><strong>Pass or Deny</strong><br>Mark relevant checkboxes on your inspection sheet and use official stamps \u2014 \u201cApprove\u201d or \u201cReject.\u201d<br>Each decision affects your score. Three mistakes per day, and you\u2019ll have to restart your shift.<br><br><strong>Progress &amp; Choices</strong><br>Work through 7 in-game days, meet 29 unique guests, and encounter 3 key characters whose stories go far beyond the inspection desk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.poster.avif?t=1762202183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.webm?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046550/extras/1a4f1953cad3271b0e73e438fca5d295.mp4?t=1762202183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf34 Features</h2>\ud83d\udc84 Immersive 2D visual style inspired by glossy 2000s aesthetics and stylized art.<br>\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f 7 days of branching scenarios with increasing difficulty and new mechanics.<br>\ud83d\udd25 X-Ray and thermal scanning systems for deeper gameplay interaction.<br>\ud83d\ude08 29 distinct characters, each with unique visuals, personalities, and secrets.<br>\ud83d\ude0f 3 story-driven encounters with extended dialogues and multiple outcomes.<br>\ud83d\udca6 A mix of simulation me